## 11. Challenges Faced

* Limited hardware resources (8 GB RAM)
* Long training times for deep learning models
* YOLO label normalization issues
* Model accuracy limitations due to dataset size
* Deployment path and dependency management

---

## 12. Conclusion

SmartVision AI successfully demonstrates the use of transfer learning and object detection techniques for intelligent image understanding.

The project integrates image classification, object detection, model evaluation, and web deployment into a single system. MobileNetV2 achieved the best classification performance, while YOLOv8 provided object localization capabilities.

Future improvements may include larger datasets, data augmentation, hyperparameter tuning, and deployment using cloud infrastructure.

---

